    "text": "\u003c@U0BTUQGHDDF\u003e Thanks for checking. `payment_response` is in the `john_jacobs` database, but the source is configured with database `POS`. A MySQL source in OLake discovers tables from the configured database only, so tables in `john_jacobs` do not appear.\n\nFrom the logs:\n```Starting discover for MySQL database POS```\n\nA new source pointing to `john_jacobs` database/schema and a job can be created to resolve this.",
